[[Open This|How do I offboard a user from a project?]]

---

https://docs.oxide.computer/guides/operator/faq#_how_do_i_offboard_a_user_from_a_project

If the user is given access to the project via the identity provider group membership, you can simply disassociate the user from the groups being granted the project roles.

If the user is granted a project role directly in the access policy, the silo or project administrator can remove their access from the policy itself.